(6378745, 944365, 35545, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition.  Just a suggestion, but you might crop out the dark line across the top.  It pulls the viewer out the the frame and away from the figures and the "good stuff" at the bottom.</td>', 'Very interesting composition.  Just a suggestion, but you might crop out the dark line across the top.  It pulls the viewer out the the frame and away from the figures and the "good stuff" at the bottom.', '2011-04-08 03:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
