(6378853, 944747, 114233, '<td valign="top">Would love to see more detail and to know how that tree is just hanging there... but I guess that is half the magic of this shot. Well spotted and hope it does well!</td>', 'Would love to see more detail and to know how that tree is just hanging there... but I guess that is half the magic of this shot. Well spotted and hope it does well!', '2011-04-08 08:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
