(6379054, 945130, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think the wide frame is a bit overpowering and I''m a HUGE frame fan.  I like the starkness and contrasts of the tree branches against the black background.</td>', 'I think the wide frame is a bit overpowering and I''m a HUGE frame fan.  I like the starkness and contrasts of the tree branches against the black background.', '2011-04-08 10:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379056, 942732, 15711, '<td valign="top">Seriously, like a vintage shot. I like the deep tones and the clouds. The grain isn''t overpowering and really works.</td>', 'Seriously, like a vintage shot. I like the deep tones and the clouds. The grain isn''t overpowering and really works.', '2011-04-08 10:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379061, 945241, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting and thoughtful.  I can see this hanging in a gallery.  Perfect title.  I hate to admit this, but when it first popped up, I thought that was Hitler!  ROFL  I had to put on my glasses to tell it was President Obama. This isn''t slick and overly contrived like so many of the entries.  I quite think it fits into the fine arts category nicely. 7</td>', 'Interesting and thoughtful.  I can see this hanging in a gallery.  Perfect title.  I hate to admit this, but when it first popped up, I thought that was Hitler!  ROFL  I had to put on my glasses to tell it was President Obama. This isn''t slick and overly contrived like so many of the entries.  I quite think it fits into the fine arts category nicely. 7', '2011-04-08 10:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379064, 945020, 15711, '<td valign="top">this is lovely.  I really like the high key approach.</td>', 'this is lovely.  I really like the high key approach.', '2011-04-08 10:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379065, 945137, 15711, '<td valign="top">HAHA  Great title.  I like the textures and tonal range. 7</td>', 'HAHA  Great title.  I like the textures and tonal range. 7', '2011-04-08 10:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379067, 945082, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh I love the low key approach.  Perfect title and certainly worthy of the fine art category.</td>', 'Oh I love the low key approach.  Perfect title and certainly worthy of the fine art category.', '2011-04-08 10:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379072, 945187, 22459, '<td valign="top">To me this is what fine art is all about in a photography sense. I love the surreal effect from the water reflection. What I like the most is that there is no need for quirky off-beat subjects or dramatic post processing to give this image a total abstract feel.  <br/>Congratulations this in my view should be on the front page.</td>', 'To me this is what fine art is all about in a photography sense. I love the surreal effect from the water reflection. What I like the most is that there is no need for quirky off-beat subjects or dramatic post processing to give this image a total abstract feel.  Congratulations this in my view should be on the front page.', '2011-04-08 10:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379073, 945177, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is lovely.  So many of these entries are contrived. This is staged but it works for me.  I like the hint of blue on the eggs and the way they are equally as focused as the orchid.  I can see it on a huge canvas, hanging in a modern home over a sleek no-frills couch.</td>', 'This is lovely.  So many of these entries are contrived. This is staged but it works for me.  I like the hint of blue on the eggs and the way they are equally as focused as the orchid.  I can see it on a huge canvas, hanging in a modern home over a sleek no-frills couch.', '2011-04-08 10:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379074, 944668, 15711, '<td valign="top">He''s on fire!!! ;)</td>', 'He''s on fire!!! ;)', '2011-04-08 10:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379078, 944750, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting crop. I rather like it.</td>', 'Interesting crop. I rather like it.', '2011-04-08 10:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
