(6379082, 945058, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting and thought provoking.  I''m trying to analyze and figure out the title.  I''m curious how you did it.</td>', 'Interesting and thought provoking.  I''m trying to analyze and figure out the title.  I''m curious how you did it.', '2011-04-08 10:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379087, 942587, 15711, '<td valign="top">Yep - I can see this in a modern art gallery.  It speaks to our society doesn''t it?  McDonalds is as far from art as it gets, yet this is a statement on our social consciousness and skewed importance.  Well done.</td>', 'Yep - I can see this in a modern art gallery.  It speaks to our society doesn''t it?  McDonalds is as far from art as it gets, yet this is a statement on our social consciousness and skewed importance.  Well done.', '2011-04-08 10:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379102, 945024, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m having a hard time distinguishing in my mind, the difference in fine art and modern art.  Are they the same?  Hmmmm - not sure.  I certainly put this in the modern art category.  I like the elements of surrealism.</td>', 'I''m having a hard time distinguishing in my mind, the difference in fine art and modern art.  Are they the same?  Hmmmm - not sure.  I certainly put this in the modern art category.  I like the elements of surrealism.', '2011-04-08 10:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379104, 945099, 36843, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, and composition</td>', 'Nice tones, and composition', '2011-04-08 10:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379106, 944669, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to think of the photographer who took the photos of the families during the Dust Bowl of the 30''s.  This is certainly reminiscent of her work, although a touch less harsh in the focus.  Maybe a bit contrived, unless this woman really has been abused.  I like that it speaks to our social consciousness, either way.</td>', 'I''m trying to think of the photographer who took the photos of the families during the Dust Bowl of the 30''s.  This is certainly reminiscent of her work, although a touch less harsh in the focus.  Maybe a bit contrived, unless this woman really has been abused.  I like that it speaks to our social consciousness, either way.', '2011-04-08 10:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
