(6379110, 945100, 15711, '<td valign="top">There are many blurred images in this challenge and most are leaving me cold.  This, on the other hand, does not.  I like the colors and the painterly quality.  The juxtaposition between the trunks and the branches is nice, adding a sense of movement, almost.  I can actually see this appearing in a gallery.  If you stretched in on canvas, it would indeed look like a painting. I like that one "stroke" of white slightly off center to the right.</td>', 'There are many blurred images in this challenge and most are leaving me cold.  This, on the other hand, does not.  I like the colors and the painterly quality.  The juxtaposition between the trunks and the branches is nice, adding a sense of movement, almost.  I can actually see this appearing in a gallery.  If you stretched in on canvas, it would indeed look like a painting. I like that one "stroke" of white slightly off center to the right.', '2011-04-08 10:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379111, 945014, 36843, '<td valign="top">I like it</td>', 'I like it', '2011-04-08 10:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
