(6379150, 943971, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m having a hard time defining ''fine art'' from a ''good photo."  I think they are mutually exclusive as their outcomes are not the same.  Or are they?  Hmmm I''m going to think on that one.  I like the tonal range and the narrower than expected DOF. :)</td>', 'I''m having a hard time defining ''fine art'' from a ''good photo."  I think they are mutually exclusive as their outcomes are not the same.  Or are they?  Hmmm I''m going to think on that one.  I like the tonal range and the narrower than expected DOF. :)', '2011-04-08 11:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
