(6379152, 944639, 15711, '<td valign="top">Fine art is hard to explain. I think this is gorgeous and love the mostly high key approach. Is it a really good photo?  YES!  Is it fine art?  I''m not so sure.  Good luck. :)</td>', 'Fine art is hard to explain. I think this is gorgeous and love the mostly high key approach. Is it a really good photo?  YES!  Is it fine art?  I''m not so sure.  Good luck. :)', '2011-04-08 11:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379154, 945082, 35545, '<td valign="top">Really interesting trees.  This is just me, but I''d brighten the sky just a tad.</td>', 'Really interesting trees.  This is just me, but I''d brighten the sky just a tad.', '2011-04-08 11:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379156, 945254, 15711, '<td valign="top">To me, this would be more in the category of modern art, although it is a great photo, executed with thoughtfulness and good focus.  Is fine art and contemporary art mutually exclusive?  I think so, but maybe I"m wrong.  Good luck!!</td>', 'To me, this would be more in the category of modern art, although it is a great photo, executed with thoughtfulness and good focus.  Is fine art and contemporary art mutually exclusive?  I think so, but maybe I"m wrong.  Good luck!!', '2011-04-08 11:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379157, 945230, 35545, '<td valign="top">Interesting shapes.</td>', 'Interesting shapes.', '2011-04-08 11:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379160, 944823, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m coming back to this.  Some might just see a concrete and tile corridor, but as I study it, I see more.  The juxtaposition of the shapes and angles, not to mention the light and shadows is really good.  I like the textures and the almost abstractness of it as a whole.  This is well done.  The discussion of fine art is going to go on ad infinitum but I put this image into that category.  I''m upping the score. GOOD LUCK.</td>', 'I''m coming back to this.  Some might just see a concrete and tile corridor, but as I study it, I see more.  The juxtaposition of the shapes and angles, not to mention the light and shadows is really good.  I like the textures and the almost abstractness of it as a whole.  This is well done.  The discussion of fine art is going to go on ad infinitum but I put this image into that category.  I''m upping the score. GOOD LUCK.', '2011-04-08 11:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379161, 944960, 35545, '<td valign="top">Very cool wall and plants.  For viewing on our landscape monitors, I think this might be better with the green foliage at the bottom cropped out.  IMNSHO, it has more strength as a squarish crop.</td>', 'Very cool wall and plants.  For viewing on our landscape monitors, I think this might be better with the green foliage at the bottom cropped out.  IMNSHO, it has more strength as a squarish crop.', '2011-04-08 11:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379163, 945051, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice b&amp;w conversion.  Not crazy about the angle.</td>', 'Nice b&w conversion.  Not crazy about the angle.', '2011-04-08 11:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379165, 945169, 15711, '<td valign="top">The discussion of fine art will go on long after all of us are gone, but to me, fine art and a great photo are not the same.  Does this evoke an emotional aesthetic in me?  Not really.  Is it thoughtful and beautifully captured?  Yes. Something about the pylon''s position in the shot is just not quite right for me.  I think if it were mine, I''d have it more "off center" but that''s just me.  Good luck.</td>', 'The discussion of fine art will go on long after all of us are gone, but to me, fine art and a great photo are not the same.  Does this evoke an emotional aesthetic in me?  Not really.  Is it thoughtful and beautifully captured?  Yes. Something about the pylon''s position in the shot is just not quite right for me.  I think if it were mine, I''d have it more "off center" but that''s just me.  Good luck.', '2011-04-08 11:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379168, 944050, 96574, '<td valign="top">so dreamlike, love it. 8</td>', 'so dreamlike, love it. 8', '2011-04-08 11:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
