(6379399, 945215, 65319, '<td valign="top">LOL...that cat looks so familiar...<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=27133" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Judi</a>''s cat?!  This image portrays exactly how I feel about this challenge (I''m the dog)!  Hope this one does well for you!  (no vote)</td>', 'LOL...that cat looks so familiar... Judi''s cat?!  This image portrays exactly how I feel about this challenge (I''m the dog)!  Hope this one does well for you!  (no vote)', '2011-04-08 14:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
