(6379469, 944050, 70896, '<td valign="top">I think I''m in love with this... One of my only two 10s!! Hope this scores real high, or even better, gets a ribbon!!</td>', 'I think I''m in love with this... One of my only two 10s!! Hope this scores real high, or even better, gets a ribbon!!', '2011-04-08 16:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379470, 945083, 70896, '<td valign="top">I gave two 10s on this challenge, and this is one of them! There''s something so dreamlike about it! Love it!</td>', 'I gave two 10s on this challenge, and this is one of them! There''s something so dreamlike about it! Love it!', '2011-04-08 16:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379471, 945245, 129195, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this...but I''m partial to gas masks haha. - 10</td>', 'I LOVE this...but I''m partial to gas masks haha. - 10', '2011-04-08 16:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379472, 945203, 70896, '<td valign="top">So beautiful! 9</td>', 'So beautiful! 9', '2011-04-08 16:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379474, 944747, 70896, '<td valign="top">So simple and well done! Love the shadows... they could be a tad bit stronger! Maybe up the contrast? 9</td>', 'So simple and well done! Love the shadows... they could be a tad bit stronger! Maybe up the contrast? 9', '2011-04-08 16:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379475, 944832, 70896, '<td valign="top">The top is a bit too blown out for me, but it''s still a great, interesting and original shot! 9</td>', 'The top is a bit too blown out for me, but it''s still a great, interesting and original shot! 9', '2011-04-08 16:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379477, 944059, 70896, '<td valign="top">Very cool! Love the detail!</td>', 'Very cool! Love the detail!', '2011-04-08 16:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379479, 945163, 70896, '<td valign="top">Love it! Very original! The darkness makes it so misterious, like, what else is he hiding under there? 9</td>', 'Love it! Very original! The darkness makes it so misterious, like, what else is he hiding under there? 9', '2011-04-08 16:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379480, 944486, 70896, '<td valign="top">I really like this... the only thing im not a big fan of is the line goes out of the frame on the right.. it feels too centered and it takes my eye out of the shot. (Not sure if im explaining myself right... I hope I am!) 9 from me! :)</td>', 'I really like this... the only thing im not a big fan of is the line goes out of the frame on the right.. it feels too centered and it takes my eye out of the shot. (Not sure if im explaining myself right... I hope I am!) 9 from me! :)', '2011-04-08 16:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379482, 945020, 70896, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pose, and the softnes makes it just right! 9</td>', 'Beautiful pose, and the softnes makes it just right! 9', '2011-04-08 16:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379498, 945111, 30214, '<td valign="top">I love this image, tones, composition, DOF. my only quibble is that you seem to have "worked" on the eye a bit too much. I would prefer a pleasure of "discovering" the eye on my own instead of being forcefully led to it.</td>', 'I love this image, tones, composition, DOF. my only quibble is that you seem to have "worked" on the eye a bit too much. I would prefer a pleasure of "discovering" the eye on my own instead of being forcefully led to it.', '2011-04-08 16:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379500, 945083, 30214, '<td valign="top">lovely image! it feels very cold, where are you in the world?</td>', 'lovely image! it feels very cold, where are you in the world?', '2011-04-08 16:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379502, 944184, 30214, '<td valign="top">the over the top colors somehow make it work very well as a surreal Dali-esque scene.</td>', 'the over the top colors somehow make it work very well as a surreal Dali-esque scene.', '2011-04-08 16:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379527, 944621, 35804, '<td valign="top">The pink makes it perfect.</td>', 'The pink makes it perfect.', '2011-04-08 17:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379555, 943177, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Wish the ducks were a bit more visible.</td>', 'Beautiful. Wish the ducks were a bit more visible.', '2011-04-08 18:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379556, 944365, 76335, '<td valign="top">Quality is a bit rough from what I''d expect of "Fine Art" (but who looks at fine art on a computer anyway?). I can overlook it. The composition is excellent -- the black horizon (or is it water?) in the background, the wooden structure in the front, the shadowy figures -- and the sand which seems to shimmer and shift. Really good.</td>', 'Quality is a bit rough from what I''d expect of "Fine Art" (but who looks at fine art on a computer anyway?). I can overlook it. The composition is excellent -- the black horizon (or is it water?) in the background, the wooden structure in the front, the shadowy figures -- and the sand which seems to shimmer and shift. Really good.', '2011-04-08 18:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379557, 943357, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful the way it stretches across the frame. So nebulous.</td>', 'Beautiful the way it stretches across the frame. So nebulous.', '2011-04-08 18:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379558, 945249, 76335, '<td valign="top">Fall meets spring? Beautifully executed.</td>', 'Fall meets spring? Beautifully executed.', '2011-04-08 18:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379561, 945181, 108069, '<td valign="top">I am taking a chance and assuming this is gyaban. I gave this a 7 because it is technically perfect, it''s a highly creative concept and relevant commentary, but I do think I can guess as to why it''s not doing as well as you''ve expected.<br/> <br/>Silly as it sounds, it''s too clear. It''s all revealed immediately. There''s an interesting concept, but not much of a story and no mystery.<br/> <br/>These are certainly not flaws, but in this pseudo-intellectual challenge, I think the voters might be demanding an accidental masterpiece, so to speak, and this might be too controlled.<br/> <br/>For what it''s worth, of course.</td>', 'I am taking a chance and assuming this is gyaban. I gave this a 7 because it is technically perfect, it''s a highly creative concept and relevant commentary, but I do think I can guess as to why it''s not doing as well as you''ve expected. Silly as it sounds, it''s too clear. It''s all revealed immediately. There''s an interesting concept, but not much of a story and no mystery. These are certainly not flaws, but in this pseudo-intellectual challenge, I think the voters might be demanding an accidental masterpiece, so to speak, and this might be too controlled. For what it''s worth, of course.', '2011-04-08 18:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379563, 942573, 115307, '<td valign="top">I really love the idea of the piece and the general feel with the matching pastel pinks throughout the image. However, the turny thing (lol, sorry I don''t know what its called) is far too obviously made out of cardboard, and that really brings the image down in my opinion. I would have made the inside edges smoother, or at the very least tried to smooth it out in photoshop. Anyways, besides that its a great idea and really well executed. 6</td>', 'I really love the idea of the piece and the general feel with the matching pastel pinks throughout the image. However, the turny thing (lol, sorry I don''t know what its called) is far too obviously made out of cardboard, and that really brings the image down in my opinion. I would have made the inside edges smoother, or at the very least tried to smooth it out in photoshop. Anyways, besides that its a great idea and really well executed. 6', '2011-04-08 18:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379565, 944669, 76335, '<td valign="top">The subject matter makes a blunt statement that''s hard to ignore -- one that doesn''t need any help. For that matter, the dark processing was unnecessary and only detracts.</td>', 'The subject matter makes a blunt statement that''s hard to ignore -- one that doesn''t need any help. For that matter, the dark processing was unnecessary and only detracts.', '2011-04-08 18:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379566, 945098, 76335, '<td valign="top">Kind of Warhol. Kind of not.</td>', 'Kind of Warhol. Kind of not.', '2011-04-08 18:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379567, 945187, 115307, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous and definitely something I would hang up on my wall. I love the rays of light, and the composition of the birds is very pleasing. Not to mention the squiggly reflections in the water, which is very interesting. 9</td>', 'This is gorgeous and definitely something I would hang up on my wall. I love the rays of light, and the composition of the birds is very pleasing. Not to mention the squiggly reflections in the water, which is very interesting. 9', '2011-04-08 18:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379568, 944611, 76335, '<td valign="top">Processing is over the top, and I don''t care for her looking away.</td>', 'Processing is over the top, and I don''t care for her looking away.', '2011-04-08 18:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379570, 944585, 115307, '<td valign="top">Very visually pleasing, I like it! I think the conversion to black and white was a very good decision. 7</td>', 'Very visually pleasing, I like it! I think the conversion to black and white was a very good decision. 7', '2011-04-08 18:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379571, 943106, 76335, '<td valign="top">An accidental canvas. Beautiful.</td>', 'An accidental canvas. Beautiful.', '2011-04-08 18:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379572, 944336, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely disorienting. Framed and processed to maximum effect.</td>', 'Nicely disorienting. Framed and processed to maximum effect.', '2011-04-08 18:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379573, 945151, 76335, '<td valign="top">Disability meets decay. Strangely beautiful.</td>', 'Disability meets decay. Strangely beautiful.', '2011-04-08 18:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379574, 945014, 115307, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really strike me as fine art. What message, emotion, or thought is this supposed to convey to me? Why should I glance at it for more than a second? The answers to these questions is what determines fine art to me.<br/> I do like the colors and the composition. 5</td>', 'Doesn''t really strike me as fine art. What message, emotion, or thought is this supposed to convey to me? Why should I glance at it for more than a second? The answers to these questions is what determines fine art to me. I do like the colors and the composition. 5', '2011-04-08 18:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379575, 944634, 76335, '<td valign="top">All the elements in perfect harmony. The tilt of the bird in flight nails it.</td>', 'All the elements in perfect harmony. The tilt of the bird in flight nails it.', '2011-04-08 18:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379576, 945187, 108069, '<td valign="top">Lovely image. Perfect for this challenge. Nice stuff.<br/> <br/>Back to look again. Such a beautiful photo.</td>', 'Lovely image. Perfect for this challenge. Nice stuff. Back to look again. Such a beautiful photo.', '2011-04-08 18:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379577, 944333, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen and composed. Vignette not needed.</td>', 'Nicely seen and composed. Vignette not needed.', '2011-04-08 18:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379578, 945156, 115307, '<td valign="top">I like this. I can definitely see this hanging on a wall somewhere. Perhaps not my wall, but maybe a surfer shop. I like the bright muted colors, but would wish that a little more of the shell was in the frame. 7</td>', 'I like this. I can definitely see this hanging on a wall somewhere. Perhaps not my wall, but maybe a surfer shop. I like the bright muted colors, but would wish that a little more of the shell was in the frame. 7', '2011-04-08 18:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379580, 944342, 76335, '<td valign="top">The greenish processing is a little offputting. I might change my mind about it though.</td>', 'The greenish processing is a little offputting. I might change my mind about it though.', '2011-04-08 18:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379581, 945026, 76335, '<td valign="top">The blue petals echo the golden bokeh quite nicely.</td>', 'The blue petals echo the golden bokeh quite nicely.', '2011-04-08 18:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379582, 944173, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Nice depth and lines, great tones. Shattered. Very cool.<br/> <br/>Bumping to 10 as it''s fairly captivating. It''s got a great mix of movement and depth, and detail. Excellent.</td>', 'Great shot. Nice depth and lines, great tones. Shattered. Very cool. Bumping to 10 as it''s fairly captivating. It''s got a great mix of movement and depth, and detail. Excellent.', '2011-04-08 18:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379583, 945175, 76335, '<td valign="top">The way that tree sits in the frame... It seems to levitate.</td>', 'The way that tree sits in the frame... It seems to levitate.', '2011-04-08 18:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379584, 944966, 76335, '<td valign="top">The blinding light and the tilt really subtract from this image.</td>', 'The blinding light and the tilt really subtract from this image.', '2011-04-08 18:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379585, 945024, 76335, '<td valign="top">Well, okay. Why not. Good. I suspect I''ll appreciate it more as the week goes on.</td>', 'Well, okay. Why not. Good. I suspect I''ll appreciate it more as the week goes on.', '2011-04-08 18:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379586, 944320, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautifully understated. Soft and subtle. Good.</td>', 'Beautifully understated. Soft and subtle. Good.', '2011-04-08 18:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379587, 944987, 76335, '<td valign="top">Too quirky to dislike.</td>', 'Too quirky to dislike.', '2011-04-08 18:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379592, 945254, 76335, '<td valign="top">The title gets you an extra point.</td>', 'The title gets you an extra point.', '2011-04-08 18:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379593, 945163, 76335, '<td valign="top">You know, and shame on me, but I almost missed the skull. Terrifying as it is funny as it is terrifying, ad infinitum.</td>', 'You know, and shame on me, but I almost missed the skull. Terrifying as it is funny as it is terrifying, ad infinitum.', '2011-04-08 19:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379594, 944601, 76335, '<td valign="top">Poses are entirely too perfect. The processing is a bit too dark and muddy though.</td>', 'Poses are entirely too perfect. The processing is a bit too dark and muddy though.', '2011-04-08 19:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
