(6379801, 945058, 93283, '<td valign="top">Hmm... Not sure I''m connecting this shot to its title, but I really like it regardless. Perhaps its the fact that I can''t connect it and that it leaves me wondering, is what keeps me intrigued. Truthfully, I don''t want to know what it is, its the mystique that really sets it off for me. Emotion and intrigue are great examples of Fine Art 8</td>', 'Hmm... Not sure I''m connecting this shot to its title, but I really like it regardless. Perhaps its the fact that I can''t connect it and that it leaves me wondering, is what keeps me intrigued. Truthfully, I don''t want to know what it is, its the mystique that really sets it off for me. Emotion and intrigue are great examples of Fine Art 8', '2011-04-08 22:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379803, 945248, 93283, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, I think its a great example of Fine art, because it makes you Stop... Interpret... and comprehend... This often leads to feeling an emotion, and mine is peacefulness... well done! 9</td>', 'I really like this shot, I think its a great example of Fine art, because it makes you Stop... Interpret... and comprehend... This often leads to feeling an emotion, and mine is peacefulness... well done! 9', '2011-04-08 22:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379804, 945187, 93283, '<td valign="top">This is one of my hopes for the front page... Majestic shot that conveys a wide range of emotions and sums up Fine Art all in one... a perfect 10</td>', 'This is one of my hopes for the front page... Majestic shot that conveys a wide range of emotions and sums up Fine Art all in one... a perfect 10', '2011-04-08 22:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379806, 943971, 93283, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, clever depth of field and it makes you stop and think about its location 6</td>', 'I like this shot, clever depth of field and it makes you stop and think about its location 6', '2011-04-08 22:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379807, 945100, 93283, '<td valign="top">This shot has an interesting and surreal sense to it. I like the overall mood and ambiance of the shot 8</td>', 'This shot has an interesting and surreal sense to it. I like the overall mood and ambiance of the shot 8', '2011-04-08 22:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379808, 945111, 93283, '<td valign="top">This shot to me is fascinating. Really a great capture and great DoF... Fine Art makes you stop and wonder, feel emotion, and then interpret what you just saw. This image does all three masterfully, 9</td>', 'This shot to me is fascinating. Really a great capture and great DoF... Fine Art makes you stop and wonder, feel emotion, and then interpret what you just saw. This image does all three masterfully, 9', '2011-04-08 22:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379809, 945082, 93283, '<td valign="top">Well... I''m at a loss for words... Tremendous shot that fits the challenge perfectly... Also, excellent job of tying in the title to the shot, its a perfect 10</td>', 'Well... I''m at a loss for words... Tremendous shot that fits the challenge perfectly... Also, excellent job of tying in the title to the shot, its a perfect 10', '2011-04-08 22:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379813, 943485, 93283, '<td valign="top">So far my third 10 of the challenge, this shot to me is the embodiment of Fine Art... It shows that you don''t have to have grain, or black and white, but you can still break the rule of having a razor sharp image, so long as the viewer is emotionally connected to the shot and drawn into the photo... Masterfully done!</td>', 'So far my third 10 of the challenge, this shot to me is the embodiment of Fine Art... It shows that you don''t have to have grain, or black and white, but you can still break the rule of having a razor sharp image, so long as the viewer is emotionally connected to the shot and drawn into the photo... Masterfully done!', '2011-04-08 22:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379855, 944823, 33672, '<td valign="top">Needs more shadowplay. Great POV though.</td>', 'Needs more shadowplay. Great POV though.', '2011-04-08 23:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379857, 943613, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice conception and representation.</td>', 'Nice conception and representation.', '2011-04-08 23:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379859, 944059, 33672, '<td valign="top">Perfect. real Art.</td>', 'Perfect. real Art.', '2011-04-08 23:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379860, 945027, 33672, '<td valign="top">Sweet mist shot. Perfect tones....10</td>', 'Sweet mist shot. Perfect tones....10', '2011-04-09 00:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379861, 943485, 33672, '<td valign="top">real art! Nice work!</td>', 'real art! Nice work!', '2011-04-09 00:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379864, 945025, 33672, '<td valign="top">More contrast would makes this powerful.</td>', 'More contrast would makes this powerful.', '2011-04-09 00:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379865, 944634, 33672, '<td valign="top">Simple yet deep. Title''s perfect.</td>', 'Simple yet deep. Title''s perfect.', '2011-04-09 00:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379867, 944649, 33672, '<td valign="top">Reality emerges from the painted world.  Perfect 10.</td>', 'Reality emerges from the painted world.  Perfect 10.', '2011-04-09 00:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379871, 942785, 33672, '<td valign="top">Even the clouds seem to being taking a right turn. Nice landscape with more than initially meets the eye.</td>', 'Even the clouds seem to being taking a right turn. Nice landscape with more than initially meets the eye.', '2011-04-09 00:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6379873, 944232, 76335, '<td valign="top">The stillest of still life. Thanks for breathing some fresh (if quirky) life into a tired photographic genre.</td>', 'The stillest of still life. Thanks for breathing some fresh (if quirky) life into a tired photographic genre.', '2011-04-09 00:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
