(6380000, 945111, 36843, '<td valign="top">Man your creep''n me out</td>', 'Man your creep''n me out', '2011-04-09 02:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380003, 944562, 129091, '<td valign="top">I like the colors.  IMO I would not center the subject.  Move it to the left or to the right a tad when you frame in your image.  Becareful with shadows, on my monitor they look really dark and are distracting.  I do like the glow in leaf it gives it some interest!</td>', 'I like the colors.  IMO I would not center the subject.  Move it to the left or to the right a tad when you frame in your image.  Becareful with shadows, on my monitor they look really dark and are distracting.  I do like the glow in leaf it gives it some interest!', '2011-04-09 02:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
