(6380078, 944408, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''ve sat here, looking at your photo for several minutes now, mulling things over, and I''m still not really sure what this triggers in me. Lots of different things, I suppose, and I like that about it. An ambiguous yet loud image.</td>', 'I''ve sat here, looking at your photo for several minutes now, mulling things over, and I''m still not really sure what this triggers in me. Lots of different things, I suppose, and I like that about it. An ambiguous yet loud image.', '2011-04-09 05:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
