(6380083, 945244, 93565, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplification of form in this. The contrast has removed much from the photo. Despite the fact that nearly all of the details that constitute the human form have been removed, we still instinctively know and feel.</td>', 'I really like the simplification of form in this. The contrast has removed much from the photo. Despite the fact that nearly all of the details that constitute the human form have been removed, we still instinctively know and feel.', '2011-04-09 05:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
