(6380091, 945137, 93565, '<td valign="top">Our pipe dreams, cobbled together of this and that at our disposal.</td>', 'Our pipe dreams, cobbled together of this and that at our disposal.', '2011-04-09 06:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380093, 944699, 93565, '<td valign="top">I love the streaking veins. They almost appear to be bursting, traveling and moving out of the frame. That burning edge at the bottom brings me back again to the bottom, revisiting the explosion again.</td>', 'I love the streaking veins. They almost appear to be bursting, traveling and moving out of the frame. That burning edge at the bottom brings me back again to the bottom, revisiting the explosion again.', '2011-04-09 06:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380094, 944365, 93565, '<td valign="top">The way the people don''t seem to be taking a step really, and are silhouetted, gives a bit of an eerie feel to this. Faceless on the deserted beach, hanging in space.</td>', 'The way the people don''t seem to be taking a step really, and are silhouetted, gives a bit of an eerie feel to this. Faceless on the deserted beach, hanging in space.', '2011-04-09 06:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380095, 945150, 93565, '<td valign="top">Strikes me as a self-referential work, a commentary on its own existence. A mundane photo of the mundane postmodern piece. Are criticisms of criticisms empty?</td>', 'Strikes me as a self-referential work, a commentary on its own existence. A mundane photo of the mundane postmodern piece. Are criticisms of criticisms empty?', '2011-04-09 06:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380096, 944639, 93565, '<td valign="top">More of the sort of photo I''d picture seeing in a "normal" challenge here on DPC, but still a very pleasing photo. Nice job aligning your focal plane with the body/wings- opportunities like these don''t afford themselves often.</td>', 'More of the sort of photo I''d picture seeing in a "normal" challenge here on DPC, but still a very pleasing photo. Nice job aligning your focal plane with the body/wings- opportunities like these don''t afford themselves often.', '2011-04-09 06:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380097, 945170, 93565, '<td valign="top">The textures on this are killer. Alternating between smooth like an oil panting and edged like the strokes of a paintbrush upon acrylic. Interesting how the kayaker initially doesn''t present itself with a coherent form, yet once identified, they spring undeniably from the water. Wonder if this is <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=20799" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Tome</a>... in due time.</td>', 'The textures on this are killer. Alternating between smooth like an oil panting and edged like the strokes of a paintbrush upon acrylic. Interesting how the kayaker initially doesn''t present itself with a coherent form, yet once identified, they spring undeniably from the water. Wonder if this is  Tome... in due time.', '2011-04-09 06:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380098, 945005, 93565, '<td valign="top">A striking image, no doubt. I honestly can''t decide about the apple and depth of field...good arguments for both approaches. The lighting is very nice, interesting. This photo excels at texture, daring the viewer''s eyes to creep up and through the crenelations and depth of the photo. At it''s heart though, this photo is the gaze, and the rest is simply artifice.</td>', 'A striking image, no doubt. I honestly can''t decide about the apple and depth of field...good arguments for both approaches. The lighting is very nice, interesting. This photo excels at texture, daring the viewer''s eyes to creep up and through the crenelations and depth of the photo. At it''s heart though, this photo is the gaze, and the rest is simply artifice.', '2011-04-09 06:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380099, 943621, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like this. The look is haunting, not just for the distortion. I like the title, but I think that recent events have added a subtext to the word (which will of course vanish in time) that distracts the viewer from the image, which is brooding and haunting of its own accord, separate from events.</td>', 'I like this. The look is haunting, not just for the distortion. I like the title, but I think that recent events have added a subtext to the word (which will of course vanish in time) that distracts the viewer from the image, which is brooding and haunting of its own accord, separate from events.', '2011-04-09 06:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
