(6380891, 944486, 115307, '<td valign="top">I love the bokeh (good thing cause thats practically all this photo has ;-) ) 7</td>', 'I love the bokeh (good thing cause thats practically all this photo has ;-) ) 7', '2011-04-09 23:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380893, 945170, 115307, '<td valign="top">Awesome! I really like this one. Who knew that kayakers could make such nice fine art subjects. I love the movement portrayed here. Its a rush. 8</td>', 'Awesome! I really like this one. Who knew that kayakers could make such nice fine art subjects. I love the movement portrayed here. Its a rush. 8', '2011-04-09 23:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380895, 945130, 115307, '<td valign="top">I think the border works really well here. Nice composition and definitely something I could stare at for a while. 7</td>', 'I think the border works really well here. Nice composition and definitely something I could stare at for a while. 7', '2011-04-09 23:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380897, 944601, 115307, '<td valign="top">Personally, I would have cropped this tighter, cut off right under the feet so that the stool/crate isn''t in the picture. I find it to be pretty distracting, and a tighter crop would still give enough context to be effective. I think you could have scored MUCH higher with the tighter crop.<br/>I love the processing, and I LOVE the upper half of this picture. The same smug expression on both rider and cow is just too priceless. 8</td>', 'Personally, I would have cropped this tighter, cut off right under the feet so that the stool/crate isn''t in the picture. I find it to be pretty distracting, and a tighter crop would still give enough context to be effective. I think you could have scored MUCH higher with the tighter crop.I love the processing, and I LOVE the upper half of this picture. The same smug expression on both rider and cow is just too priceless. 8', '2011-04-09 23:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380898, 944832, 115307, '<td valign="top">Very effective photograph. All of the technicals are spot on but above all this connects emotionally with the viewer. Nice use of high key. I have an idea who the photographer might be, can''t wait until the challenge is over to see if I am right. 8</td>', 'Very effective photograph. All of the technicals are spot on but above all this connects emotionally with the viewer. Nice use of high key. I have an idea who the photographer might be, can''t wait until the challenge is over to see if I am right. 8', '2011-04-09 23:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380900, 945026, 115307, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! I just love this! Its very visually pleasing. The bokeh is just beautiful. Makes me think of a dream</td>', 'Gorgeous! I just love this! Its very visually pleasing. The bokeh is just beautiful. Makes me think of a dream', '2011-04-09 23:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380901, 944913, 115307, '<td valign="top">I think this could of have used an upped contrast, so that the whites are whiter and not so grey. I like the circular composition and the blur though</td>', 'I think this could of have used an upped contrast, so that the whites are whiter and not so grey. I like the circular composition and the blur though', '2011-04-09 23:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380903, 945024, 115307, '<td valign="top">Very well processed and photographed, and very interesting to look at. I think the composition is perfect. This gets high marks from me.</td>', 'Very well processed and photographed, and very interesting to look at. I think the composition is perfect. This gets high marks from me.', '2011-04-09 23:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380904, 944059, 115307, '<td valign="top">So intriguing and interesting to look at. I am amazed how you managed to photograph this. It definitely seems more like a painting where one can place things whereever one wants, instead of a photograph. Remarkable!<br/>A 10 from me, and I hope this does well for you</td>', 'So intriguing and interesting to look at. I am amazed how you managed to photograph this. It definitely seems more like a painting where one can place things whereever one wants, instead of a photograph. Remarkable!A 10 from me, and I hope this does well for you', '2011-04-09 23:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380905, 944960, 115307, '<td valign="top">This is so simple and yet so beautiful and interesting to look at. 8</td>', 'This is so simple and yet so beautiful and interesting to look at. 8', '2011-04-09 23:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380906, 945000, 115307, '<td valign="top">Woah! Scrolling rapidly up and down on this image messes with your head. Really cool!</td>', 'Woah! Scrolling rapidly up and down on this image messes with your head. Really cool!', '2011-04-09 23:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380907, 945223, 115307, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really say fine art to me, but what a precious baby portrait. I am sure most parents would love to see a picture of their newborn as a butterfly like this. 6</td>', 'This doesn''t really say fine art to me, but what a precious baby portrait. I am sure most parents would love to see a picture of their newborn as a butterfly like this. 6', '2011-04-09 23:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380909, 942587, 115307, '<td valign="top">Who knew that I would find a McDonalds wrapper so interesting to look at. Its all those wrinkles and the light play off of them. Very creative idea, most people would never have thought of it. 6</td>', 'Who knew that I would find a McDonalds wrapper so interesting to look at. Its all those wrinkles and the light play off of them. Very creative idea, most people would never have thought of it. 6', '2011-04-09 23:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380912, 945171, 115307, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been stronger if it was placed in the middle of the frame. Its too off balancing this way for me.<br/>Good idea though, awesome that you managed to turn two spoons into fine art.</td>', 'I think this would have been stronger if it was placed in the middle of the frame. Its too off balancing this way for me.Good idea though, awesome that you managed to turn two spoons into fine art.', '2011-04-10 00:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
