(6381129, 945244, 69324, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t know a piece of fine art if it fell out of the sky and hit me on the head, so I honestly don''t know if this true to the genre or not. Irregardless, this is the coolest thing I''ve seen two thirds of the way through the voting. Nice work.</td>', 'I wouldn''t know a piece of fine art if it fell out of the sky and hit me on the head, so I honestly don''t know if this true to the genre or not. Irregardless, this is the coolest thing I''ve seen two thirds of the way through the voting. Nice work.', '2011-04-10 10:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
