(6381151, 944960, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like the way you made this scene so dynamic. There are so many elements asking for attention, and I cann;t help but look at all of them in detail.</td>', 'I really like the way you made this scene so dynamic. There are so many elements asking for attention, and I cann;t help but look at all of them in detail.', '2011-04-10 10:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
