(6381500, 944232, 96751, '<td valign="top">I see Morticia was here...<br/> <br/>Beautiful tones and composition.  Really, really good.</td>', 'I see Morticia was here... Beautiful tones and composition.  Really, really good.', '2011-04-10 15:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381501, 944611, 96751, '<td valign="top">VERY painterly.</td>', 'VERY painterly.', '2011-04-10 15:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381503, 944987, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ok, the scary thing about this image is NOT that someone would actually go to all the trouble of assembling this thing out of seashells, but that someone else BOUGHT IT!!!!<br/> <br/>Absurd and quirky.  Love the softness and the light, and the setting itself is great, but somehow the subject and setting fight each other for my attention.</td>', 'Ok, the scary thing about this image is NOT that someone would actually go to all the trouble of assembling this thing out of seashells, but that someone else BOUGHT IT!!!! Absurd and quirky.  Love the softness and the light, and the setting itself is great, but somehow the subject and setting fight each other for my attention.', '2011-04-10 15:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381504, 945130, 96751, '<td valign="top">Don''t know why, but this reminds me so much of Paul Klee''s work.  There is something magical and impish about this image.  A delight.</td>', 'Don''t know why, but this reminds me so much of Paul Klee''s work.  There is something magical and impish about this image.  A delight.', '2011-04-10 15:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
