(6381507, 942790, 96751, '<td valign="top">I''m unable to verbalize why I enjoy this image so much.  The colors are SO complementary, and the glass distortion very painterly.</td>', 'I''m unable to verbalize why I enjoy this image so much.  The colors are SO complementary, and the glass distortion very painterly.', '2011-04-10 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381510, 945226, 96751, '<td valign="top">Without the title, this image is reduced in stature.  With it, an entire scene unfolds.</td>', 'Without the title, this image is reduced in stature.  With it, an entire scene unfolds.', '2011-04-10 15:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381511, 943357, 96751, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous - very interesting and unusual perspective and one of my least favorite subjects.</td>', 'Gorgeous - very interesting and unusual perspective and one of my least favorite subjects.', '2011-04-10 15:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381514, 942980, 96751, '<td valign="top">Incredibly odd.</td>', 'Incredibly odd.', '2011-04-10 15:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381518, 943971, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice leading lines.  Love the curly cues on top.</td>', 'Nice leading lines.  Love the curly cues on top.', '2011-04-10 15:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381520, 945111, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous street portraiture.</td>', 'Fabulous street portraiture.', '2011-04-10 15:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381528, 944059, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is striking me as gyabanesque, although <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=113156" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">jagar</a>''s recent winner also comes to mind.  Of course, I''m notoriously awful at matching images to their photogs, and regardless, this is a top notch image.  <br/> <br/>Everything about it screams art to me - terrific imagination and creativity, amazing thought put into details and composition, masterful pp''ing.  Absurdism meets surrealism, meets fantasy.  My front page for sure, if not a ribbon.</td>', 'This is striking me as gyabanesque, although  jagar''s recent winner also comes to mind.  Of course, I''m notoriously awful at matching images to their photogs, and regardless, this is a top notch image.   Everything about it screams art to me - terrific imagination and creativity, amazing thought put into details and composition, masterful pp''ing.  Absurdism meets surrealism, meets fantasy.  My front page for sure, if not a ribbon.', '2011-04-10 15:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381533, 945241, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wow.  You have really captured something beyond an image, here.  When this opened on my screen, I actually felt an impact on my chest, as thought the breeze agitating the curtains was informing my soul of something very important and clearly forgotten.  For me, the image on the TV is the only detracting element.</td>', 'Wow.  You have really captured something beyond an image, here.  When this opened on my screen, I actually felt an impact on my chest, as thought the breeze agitating the curtains was informing my soul of something very important and clearly forgotten.  For me, the image on the TV is the only detracting element.', '2011-04-10 15:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
