(6383067, 944960, 100831, '<td valign="top">lovely combination of elements and colors even if it is evil! Congrats too on recognition for the DPC Fine Art Gallery!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-04-19 01:15:01.</i></td>', 'lovely combination of elements and colors even if it is evil! Congrats too on recognition for the DPC Fine Art Gallery!', '2011-04-11 15:21:58.000000', '2011-04-19 02:15:01.000000', 1),
