(6383278, 945181, 41337, '<td valign="top">As an artist what are you trying to say here? That we''re all blind to the connections we make online? Anything else? I don''t get the sense that you chose this subject because you''re passonate about it, but because you felt you can do something cute/clever with it. That''s the path to creating a good commercial image not fine art.</td>', 'As an artist what are you trying to say here? That we''re all blind to the connections we make online? Anything else? I don''t get the sense that you chose this subject because you''re passonate about it, but because you felt you can do something cute/clever with it. That''s the path to creating a good commercial image not fine art.', '2011-04-11 19:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
