(6385432, 944050, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think the heavy frame overpowers the image.  I really like the hint of grain.  Nice sepia conversion. :) Me again.  I''m negating the fact that the border is thick.  I''ve looked this a dozen more times and am going to up my score.  I''m not going to erase the original stuff, so you''ll know how much I''ve gone back and forth.  Upping to an 8</td>', 'I think the heavy frame overpowers the image.  I really like the hint of grain.  Nice sepia conversion. :) Me again.  I''m negating the fact that the border is thick.  I''ve looked this a dozen more times and am going to up my score.  I''m not going to erase the original stuff, so you''ll know how much I''ve gone back and forth.  Upping to an 8', '2011-04-13 18:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
