(6385766, 945163, 30982, '<td valign="top">See, now you shoulda used broccoli.  I don''t know why, really.  Perhaps just to add an absurd element to such nicely structured reality.  Poor Yorick.</td>', 'See, now you shoulda used broccoli.  I don''t know why, really.  Perhaps just to add an absurd element to such nicely structured reality.  Poor Yorick.', '2011-04-14 00:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
