(6385898, 945241, 30364, '<td valign="top">That''s very good indeed.  The blathering ''Bama, the radiant portal to somewhere else, and the extravagant crucifix. A classic modern American holy trinity, and a very fine contemporary art photograph.  8.  Thank you.</td>', 'That''s very good indeed.  The blathering ''Bama, the radiant portal to somewhere else, and the extravagant crucifix. A classic modern American holy trinity, and a very fine contemporary art photograph.  8.  Thank you.', '2011-04-14 03:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6385901, 943106, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is graphically beautiful, but it''s more than that.  It''s a landscape and it''s a social commentary, and it''s a lovely abstract, and it''s not.  Depends how long one looks at it, and in what mood.  It has both beauty and substance, in other words.  8.  Thank you.</td>', 'This is graphically beautiful, but it''s more than that.  It''s a landscape and it''s a social commentary, and it''s a lovely abstract, and it''s not.  Depends how long one looks at it, and in what mood.  It has both beauty and substance, in other words.  8.  Thank you.', '2011-04-14 03:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6385907, 945101, 124815, '<td valign="top">While I am a little confused by the title (Gaia, Mother Earth? Oracle?) I am captivated by the image. And this is what counts. 8</td>', 'While I am a little confused by the title (Gaia, Mother Earth? Oracle?) I am captivated by the image. And this is what counts. 8', '2011-04-14 03:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6385908, 942652, 124815, '<td valign="top">Of the experiments with sheets that I see here often, this one benefits from a lovely  composition and color.</td>', 'Of the experiments with sheets that I see here often, this one benefits from a lovely  composition and color.', '2011-04-14 03:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6385912, 945226, 30364, '<td valign="top">Transcendental tug-o''-war.  And oddly compelling too.  I probably would not hang this on my wall, or at least not permanently, but if I wrote a really good psychological thriller I would ask you if I could use this for the cover.  8.  Thank you.</td>', 'Transcendental tug-o''-war.  And oddly compelling too.  I probably would not hang this on my wall, or at least not permanently, but if I wrote a really good psychological thriller I would ask you if I could use this for the cover.  8.  Thank you.', '2011-04-14 03:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6385913, 943357, 124815, '<td valign="top">Just wonderful. Jungian. 8<br/>Reviewed nd bumped to 9</td>', 'Just wonderful. Jungian. 8Reviewed nd bumped to 9', '2011-04-14 03:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6385914, 945182, 30364, '<td valign="top">I have probably spent more time looking at this one than all but a couple of entries.  Not because I''m indecisive; I liked it from the start.  It''s because it''s interesting, original and absorbing, and repays each new visit in a new way.  8.  Thank you.</td>', 'I have probably spent more time looking at this one than all but a couple of entries.  Not because I''m indecisive; I liked it from the start.  It''s because it''s interesting, original and absorbing, and repays each new visit in a new way.  8.  Thank you.', '2011-04-14 03:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6385915, 944486, 30364, '<td valign="top">Sparklingly lovely picture = 7 plus the Floyd Bonus Point = 8.  Thank you.</td>', 'Sparklingly lovely picture = 7 plus the Floyd Bonus Point = 8.  Thank you.', '2011-04-14 03:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6385916, 944747, 30364, '<td valign="top">Az.  Going for the FA juried double?  You''ve got a good shot at it; it''s a lovely, understated photograph ... classical composition, and the raking light makes the shadow sing a perfect sustained note.  Beautiful and durable.  And in my own top three choices.  9.  Thank you.</td>', 'Az.  Going for the FA juried double?  You''ve got a good shot at it; it''s a lovely, understated photograph ... classical composition, and the raking light makes the shadow sing a perfect sustained note.  Beautiful and durable.  And in my own top three choices.  9.  Thank you.', '2011-04-14 03:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6385917, 945058, 30364, '<td valign="top">Ridiculously, effortlessly well done.  Inspirational execution of a lovely concept. I stayed with you the full three breaths and it worked beautifully. Thank you.  It''s my equal top pick (of two) in the challenge.  10.</td>', 'Ridiculously, effortlessly well done.  Inspirational execution of a lovely concept. I stayed with you the full three breaths and it worked beautifully. Thank you.  It''s my equal top pick (of two) in the challenge.  10.', '2011-04-14 03:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6385918, 945247, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well I admit I knew nothing of Jack Ox until your beautiful photograph prompted me to find out.  What a fascinating person and artist she is!  The very concept of visualizing music, in the way that she pursues it, is itself quite beautiful too.  Your tribute would most likely please her very much.  It certainly pleases me; the longer I look at it the more clearly I can hear it.  <br/> <br/>I can''t separate two toweringly wonderful pictures in this challenge (nor do I need to, nor want to), and yours is one of the two.  I rarely make anything a favorite, but this is so lovely and so conceptually perfect that I have no choice!   10.  Thank you.</td>', 'Well I admit I knew nothing of Jack Ox until your beautiful photograph prompted me to find out.  What a fascinating person and artist she is!  The very concept of visualizing music, in the way that she pursues it, is itself quite beautiful too.  Your tribute would most likely please her very much.  It certainly pleases me; the longer I look at it the more clearly I can hear it.   I can''t separate two toweringly wonderful pictures in this challenge (nor do I need to, nor want to), and yours is one of the two.  I rarely make anything a favorite, but this is so lovely and so conceptually perfect that I have no choice!   10.  Thank you.', '2011-04-14 03:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6385965, 943485, 45631, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing image. Expect this will finish very well.</td>', 'Very intriguing image. Expect this will finish very well.', '2011-04-14 06:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6385977, 944059, 116666, '<td valign="top">I find this such an interesting composition, nicely done!</td>', 'I find this such an interesting composition, nicely done!', '2011-04-14 07:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6386088, 945051, 104230, '<td valign="top">I assume the lack of focus on the face is deliberate. That, the expression, and the crop provide a feeling of remoteness, but I wonder if the same effect could have been achieved just as well with the face in focus.  Lovely details and areas of light in the shawl and her hair.</td>', 'I assume the lack of focus on the face is deliberate. That, the expression, and the crop provide a feeling of remoteness, but I wonder if the same effect could have been achieved just as well with the face in focus.  Lovely details and areas of light in the shawl and her hair.', '2011-04-14 11:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6386092, 945126, 104230, '<td valign="top">Interesting image and lovely light on the headdress. I find the background distracting, especially the bright light in the upper left.  Perhaps there is some symbolism associated with that light that I am missing, since this is a fine arts challenge.</td>', 'Interesting image and lovely light on the headdress. I find the background distracting, especially the bright light in the upper left.  Perhaps there is some symbolism associated with that light that I am missing, since this is a fine arts challenge.', '2011-04-14 11:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
