(6386194, 945024, 38032, '<td valign="top">Seems artsy. A bit too contrived for my taste but certainly fits the bill (no way that pun was intended) - reminds me a bit of "eyes wide shut" with all the masks.</td>', 'Seems artsy. A bit too contrived for my taste but certainly fits the bill (no way that pun was intended) - reminds me a bit of "eyes wide shut" with all the masks.', '2011-04-14 13:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6386199, 945005, 38032, '<td valign="top">The lighting and the snake are stellar - and this guy is fantastical  the OOF apple is killing me though - I want it to be in focus soooo bad.  In fact if the apple was just sitting there on the table, I think it would be just fine but for the purpose of this great image the apple needs to be a bit more crisp since it is being presented to the viewer in such a way =)<br/>Really well done though - would love to see more stuff like this. 7</td>', 'The lighting and the snake are stellar - and this guy is fantastical  the OOF apple is killing me though - I want it to be in focus soooo bad.  In fact if the apple was just sitting there on the table, I think it would be just fine but for the purpose of this great image the apple needs to be a bit more crisp since it is being presented to the viewer in such a way =)Really well done though - would love to see more stuff like this. 7', '2011-04-14 13:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
