(6386205, 944832, 65319, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this image, I thought of this image by <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=69668" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">njsabs</a> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=933851" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1331/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_933851.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1331/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_933851.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1331/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_933851.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Your image has a more formal feel with a strong sense of finality with the crossed arms like the ancient Egyptian mummy.  The ripples and the hair provide an eerie frame to repose of her face. I anticipate this image will do well for you, Jenn!  Good Luck!  (no vote)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-04-15 16:11:42.</i></td>', 'When I first saw this image, I thought of this image by  njsabs    Your image has a more formal feel with a strong sense of finality with the crossed arms like the ancient Egyptian mummy.  The ripples and the hair provide an eerie frame to repose of her face. I anticipate this image will do well for you, Jenn!  Good Luck!  (no vote)', '2011-04-14 13:45:07.000000', '2011-04-15 17:11:42.000000', 1),
