(6386361, 945170, 61961, '<td valign="top">The only "abstract" photo in my top picks.  Successful as a free study and as contemporary art.  Beautiful, too.</td>', 'The only "abstract" photo in my top picks.  Successful as a free study and as contemporary art.  Beautiful, too.', '2011-04-14 18:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6386362, 943621, 61961, '<td valign="top">Haunting distortion.  In my top picks.  High on the contemporary art meter.</td>', 'Haunting distortion.  In my top picks.  High on the contemporary art meter.', '2011-04-14 18:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6386363, 945250, 61961, '<td valign="top">Mundane subject made artistic.  For me at least this took a few moments to decipher, so I loved it when it came together.  Certainly a worthy successor to DPC''s infamous "angry kitty scratch your eyes out" photo.  A high score from me.</td>', 'Mundane subject made artistic.  For me at least this took a few moments to decipher, so I loved it when it came together.  Certainly a worthy successor to DPC''s infamous "angry kitty scratch your eyes out" photo.  A high score from me.', '2011-04-14 18:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6386364, 945024, 61961, '<td valign="top">Silly and a bit of a spoof, but I like it!  Didn''t notice the egg until I saw the title.  Great colors.</td>', 'Silly and a bit of a spoof, but I like it!  Didn''t notice the egg until I saw the title.  Great colors.', '2011-04-14 18:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6386366, 945111, 61961, '<td valign="top">Extremely strong and human work and maybe my challenge favorite.  As for contemporary art, well, it would probably fit right in with what was cutting edge several decades ago, but it still works.  Nice treatment to bring out the eye.</td>', 'Extremely strong and human work and maybe my challenge favorite.  As for contemporary art, well, it would probably fit right in with what was cutting edge several decades ago, but it still works.  Nice treatment to bring out the eye.', '2011-04-14 18:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6386367, 944726, 67697, '<td valign="top">very clever.  love your use of shadow.  great creativity!</td>', 'very clever.  love your use of shadow.  great creativity!', '2011-04-14 18:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6386369, 945245, 61961, '<td valign="top">Like a composite.  Gasmasks + nudes = old hat, but this is still fun and intriguing, with color and interest to please, so... a high score from me.</td>', 'Like a composite.  Gasmasks + nudes = old hat, but this is still fun and intriguing, with color and interest to please, so... a high score from me.', '2011-04-14 18:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6386370, 945058, 61961, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of long exposure, works well as contemporary art.</td>', 'Very nice use of long exposure, works well as contemporary art.', '2011-04-14 18:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6386372, 945005, 67697, '<td valign="top">I really love this one - although i wish the apple were in focus.  The apple and snake make me think of the Adam and Eve story.  Like the man is behind the offering of temptation.  Love the colortone.  And the eyes are wicked cool too.</td>', 'I really love this one - although i wish the apple were in focus.  The apple and snake make me think of the Adam and Eve story.  Like the man is behind the offering of temptation.  Love the colortone.  And the eyes are wicked cool too.', '2011-04-14 18:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6386373, 944050, 61961, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of an illustration from a children''s book, or possibly something from the old Night Gallery.  I have a feeling too much of the impact is derived from the frame.  Anyhow, you have a place in my contemporary art gallery!</td>', 'Reminds me of an illustration from a children''s book, or possibly something from the old Night Gallery.  I have a feeling too much of the impact is derived from the frame.  Anyhow, you have a place in my contemporary art gallery!', '2011-04-14 18:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6386374, 945247, 61961, '<td valign="top">Everything old is new again, this seems like an experimental photo from the 1930s, but to me that is part of the appeal.  Well done.</td>', 'Everything old is new again, this seems like an experimental photo from the 1930s, but to me that is part of the appeal.  Well done.', '2011-04-14 18:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6386375, 943892, 61961, '<td valign="top">I like photos that are clearly making a statement without defining exactly what the statement is.  Could probably (therefore) do without the title but I try not to let titles sway me either way.  High marks from me.</td>', 'I like photos that are clearly making a statement without defining exactly what the statement is.  Could probably (therefore) do without the title but I try not to let titles sway me either way.  High marks from me.', '2011-04-14 18:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6386376, 945151, 61961, '<td valign="top">Nicely spotted and captured.  Simple and effective.</td>', 'Nicely spotted and captured.  Simple and effective.', '2011-04-14 18:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6386377, 945005, 61961, '<td valign="top">I try not to pay much attention to titles, but this one rocks the photo.  Nice colors and treatment.  Strong image, I love the backdrop in relation to the rest.  I''m reminded of a Tarot card.</td>', 'I try not to pay much attention to titles, but this one rocks the photo.  Nice colors and treatment.  Strong image, I love the backdrop in relation to the rest.  I''m reminded of a Tarot card.', '2011-04-14 18:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6386379, 945000, 61961, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous light!</td>', 'Gorgeous light!', '2011-04-14 18:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6386381, 945132, 61961, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous b&amp;w, classic comp.  Super as a "free study", though less impact as contemporary art photography.</td>', 'Gorgeous b&w, classic comp.  Super as a "free study", though less impact as contemporary art photography.', '2011-04-14 18:31:28.000000', NULL, 1);
