(6386614, 944232, 67697, '<td valign="top">I wanted to do something like this but could not figure out how to make it work.  This is beautiful.  I love the clarity and love the tones.  Great title too.</td>', 'I wanted to do something like this but could not figure out how to make it work.  This is beautiful.  I love the clarity and love the tones.  Great title too.', '2011-04-14 23:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6386617, 944059, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is interesting.  I love the set up and your arrangement of objects and the tulips.  I don''t really understand the title but I enjoy looking thru the scene while I try and figure it out.</td>', 'This is interesting.  I love the set up and your arrangement of objects and the tulips.  I don''t really understand the title but I enjoy looking thru the scene while I try and figure it out.', '2011-04-14 23:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
