(6386620, 945217, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and tones.  The slight hint of color works great against the darker background.  Nice capture of detail too.</td>', 'I like the lighting and tones.  The slight hint of color works great against the darker background.  Nice capture of detail too.', '2011-04-14 23:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
