(6387050, 944832, 19825, '<td valign="top">Beautiful high key shot that has a creepy eerie feel. I have trouble getting my daughter to just sit for a few pictures -- yours is quite brave. Great job, Jenn.</td>', 'Beautiful high key shot that has a creepy eerie feel. I have trouble getting my daughter to just sit for a few pictures -- yours is quite brave. Great job, Jenn.', '2011-04-15 07:22:14.000000', NULL, 0),
