(6387077, 944611, 97225, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic fine art photography - such a classic pose and the pattern in the mirror is absolutely wonderful.  I''m so glad that instructions on voting tell us to vote as if everything is legitimate even if we think it mightn''t be. I gave you a 9 but thought that this had an overlay and would end up being DQ''d. I''m very pleased to find that that was not the case.</td>', 'This is fantastic fine art photography - such a classic pose and the pattern in the mirror is absolutely wonderful.  I''m so glad that instructions on voting tell us to vote as if everything is legitimate even if we think it mightn''t be. I gave you a 9 but thought that this had an overlay and would end up being DQ''d. I''m very pleased to find that that was not the case.', '2011-04-15 09:25:56.000000', NULL, 0),
