(6387091, 944050, 15711, '<td valign="top">Got an 8 from me.<br/> <br/>Nice job.  I think that many people think "fine art" is simply an image you can hang on the wall.  To me, that is very limiting and really doesn''t have anything to do with it.  LOL  Nonetheless, it worked and I''m so happy for you.  Congrats.</td>', 'Got an 8 from me. Nice job.  I think that many people think "fine art" is simply an image you can hang on the wall.  To me, that is very limiting and really doesn''t have anything to do with it.  LOL  Nonetheless, it worked and I''m so happy for you.  Congrats.', '2011-04-15 09:53:45.000000', NULL, 0),
