(6387153, 944823, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great lines and tones in this.  Very much something that would look nice printed and hanging on a wall somewhere.  It somehow is very soothing.</td>', 'Great lines and tones in this.  Very much something that would look nice printed and hanging on a wall somewhere.  It somehow is very soothing.', '2011-04-15 11:19:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6387155, 944184, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh my dear, you ARE artistic!  Very!  And have a fine turn of the feet, too.  What more can you ask?  Oh, and what a great space to shoot in.  Awesome light, very airy and free-feeling - lovely!  My favorite part of this, by the way, is the shadow of the foot in the window on the floor.  No idea why, but there you go.</td>', 'Oh my dear, you ARE artistic!  Very!  And have a fine turn of the feet, too.  What more can you ask?  Oh, and what a great space to shoot in.  Awesome light, very airy and free-feeling - lovely!  My favorite part of this, by the way, is the shadow of the foot in the window on the floor.  No idea why, but there you go.', '2011-04-15 11:22:27.000000', NULL, 0),
