(6387178, 945058, 53814, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by colorcarnival:</b></div><hr/><i> So is this one giant cat or more than one?  How did you do this overlay?  This is a very curious shot.  Quite interesting! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks Michelle... just one cat. I exposed for 7 seconds (3 cat breaths) on the cat, and then rotated the tripod upwards and exposed for another 7 seconds on the barn stall.</td>', 'Originally posted by colorcarnival: So is this one giant cat or more than one?  How did you do this overlay?  This is a very curious shot.  Quite interesting!  Thanks Michelle... just one cat. I exposed for 7 seconds (3 cat breaths) on the cat, and then rotated the tripod upwards and exposed for another 7 seconds on the barn stall.', '2011-04-15 11:55:26.000000', NULL, 0),
