(6388024, 944184, 20799, '<td valign="top">Not only are you artistic, but you can jump really high! :) Beautiful image, the bright daylight and vibrant colors make it so free, elegant and despite your trouble, so effortless looking! I can see this framed next to the one with the chair and the tea party image. And, you have an empty room for the next challenge!<br/>Btw I don''t see how you could have used a remote here :).<br/> <br/></td>', 'Not only are you artistic, but you can jump really high! :) Beautiful image, the bright daylight and vibrant colors make it so free, elegant and despite your trouble, so effortless looking! I can see this framed next to the one with the chair and the tea party image. And, you have an empty room for the next challenge!Btw I don''t see how you could have used a remote here :). ', '2011-04-16 15:33:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6388026, 945024, 20799, '<td valign="top">As Michelle said, this is what I expected to see more in this challenge. Such a strange and beautiful scene, a well deserved center piece in a fine arts exhibit. I really thought it would ribbon.</td>', 'As Michelle said, this is what I expected to see more in this challenge. Such a strange and beautiful scene, a well deserved center piece in a fine arts exhibit. I really thought it would ribbon.', '2011-04-16 15:41:15.000000', NULL, 0),
