(6388130, 944659, 54645, '<td valign="top">Sex life? Ha! Effective composition, and as mentioned, the matching hats are comical and engaging.</td>', 'Sex life? Ha! Effective composition, and as mentioned, the matching hats are comical and engaging.', '2011-04-16 18:22:29.000000', NULL, 0),
