(6389104, 945187, 119419, '<td valign="top">Sorry about the dq, definitely still a ribbon</td>', 'Sorry about the dq, definitely still a ribbon', '2011-04-18 06:58:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6389192, 944059, 70036, '<td valign="top">The Buddha would have related....</td>', 'The Buddha would have related....', '2011-04-18 09:25:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6389198, 944611, 123833, '<td valign="top">I have to write a defense to the border. Why people hate them so much? In this case it is very clearly emphasizing the fact that this is a mirror reflection. The color of the border blends perfectly with one of the wall colors. The effect is very painterly and paintings do have a variety of frames! It does not have to be black with thin white line, does it?!<br/> <br/>PS I hope you don''t mind. The border haters get to me sometimes. This is a very fine image and your selected border matches it perfectly.</td>', 'I have to write a defense to the border. Why people hate them so much? In this case it is very clearly emphasizing the fact that this is a mirror reflection. The color of the border blends perfectly with one of the wall colors. The effect is very painterly and paintings do have a variety of frames! It does not have to be black with thin white line, does it?! PS I hope you don''t mind. The border haters get to me sometimes. This is a very fine image and your selected border matches it perfectly.', '2011-04-18 09:34:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6389205, 944205, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is weird, I just noticed the title. My current entry in the "Warm" challenge originally included "Lumiere de Matin" as part of its title, though I changed it out for something else in the end. I''m sorry this one didn''t work out better for you; it''s a lovely shot, but it''s just not hitting the popular concept of what "fine art" would be.</td>', 'This is weird, I just noticed the title. My current entry in the "Warm" challenge originally included "Lumiere de Matin" as part of its title, though I changed it out for something else in the end. I''m sorry this one didn''t work out better for you; it''s a lovely shot, but it''s just not hitting the popular concept of what "fine art" would be.', '2011-04-18 09:46:25.000000', NULL, 0),
