(6390292, 943892, 65319, '<td valign="top">Dan, I''m glad I didn''t have to buy you a snuggie this year!  I''m happy to see you made The Judges'' List and look forward to seeing what you come up with next year (or the next time this particular challenge comes around again).  For what it''s worth, I gave this image a 7.  :-)</td>', 'Dan, I''m glad I didn''t have to buy you a snuggie this year!  I''m happy to see you made The Judges'' List and look forward to seeing what you come up with next year (or the next time this particular challenge comes around again).  For what it''s worth, I gave this image a 7.  :-)', '2011-04-19 14:15:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6390318, 943892, 35334, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hihosilver:</b></div><hr/><i> Dan, I''m glad I didn''t have to buy you a snuggie this year!  I''m happy to see you made The Judges'' List . . . </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks. I''m doing very well. I will do more of the Sunset Series at some point but my personal sunset seems further in the future than it did a year ago.<br/> <br/>~~Dan<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by hihosilver: Dan, I''m glad I didn''t have to buy you a snuggie this year!  I''m happy to see you made The Judges'' List . . .   Thanks. I''m doing very well. I will do more of the Sunset Series at some point but my personal sunset seems further in the future than it did a year ago. ~~Dan', '2011-04-19 14:37:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6390370, 945241, 19825, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the Juried selection. I loved this image and scored it high during voting. I was surprised that I did not comment on it at the time -- I guess I was too hurried. I recall lingering on it for the longest time -- a testament to how fascinating it was to me. While I always seem to be rushing to the next task on the list, your photograph stopped me in my tracks. Beautiful job.</td>', 'Congratulations on the Juried selection. I loved this image and scored it high during voting. I was surprised that I did not comment on it at the time -- I guess I was too hurried. I recall lingering on it for the longest time -- a testament to how fascinating it was to me. While I always seem to be rushing to the next task on the list, your photograph stopped me in my tracks. Beautiful job.', '2011-04-19 16:19:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6390397, 942587, 19825, '<td valign="top">An average score of only 5.2? Ridiculous. I loved this during voting, and I am sorry that I did not take the time to comment on it then. I am glad this got recognized by the Jury. This is a great shot. Mass produced just for you. As the wrapper says, "I''m lovin'' it."</td>', 'An average score of only 5.2? Ridiculous. I loved this during voting, and I am sorry that I did not take the time to comment on it then. I am glad this got recognized by the Jury. This is a great shot. Mass produced just for you. As the wrapper says, "I''m lovin'' it."', '2011-04-19 17:15:47.000000', NULL, 0),
