(6391954, 942587, 55283, '<td valign="top">What really gets me for this one is its similarity to caution/police-line/warning/do-not-cross tape(especially via the thumb.) Almost as if it knows it should not be opened. The crumples give it a beat up, possibly like a crime scene, feel to me. But as Twain said, "[T]here is a charm about the forbidden that makes it unspeakably desirable," and warnings be damned, I want that burger. Well done. I gave you an 8.<br/></td>', 'What really gets me for this one is its similarity to caution/police-line/warning/do-not-cross tape(especially via the thumb.) Almost as if it knows it should not be opened. The crumples give it a beat up, possibly like a crime scene, feel to me. But as Twain said, "[T]here is a charm about the forbidden that makes it unspeakably desirable," and warnings be damned, I want that burger. Well done. I gave you an 8.', '2011-04-21 01:44:38.000000', NULL, 0),
