(6392087, 945174, 41746, '<td valign="top">I want to thank the Alternative Fine Arts Jury for awarding my Walk On By image in <a href="//www." rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Fine Arts: Exhibit 2</a> as Second Honors. The image was not well received by the voters in the challenge, placed 145 of 162 images with the avarge score of 4.81. But the jury just made my day. I am deeply humbled. <br/> <br/>The <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1072621" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">comments</a> from the jury:<br/> <br/>One image that I totally missed when voting is Walk on By. I''m liking this more and more... love the shape of the legs! Go-go boots! Colors are subtly wonderful. It makes you work and it rewards you. <br/> <br/>- I also missed Walk on By and find the shapes and colors to be gorgeous. <br/> <br/>- I like the movement, the 1960-Nancy Sinatra-ish of this. It''s so hip and cool! <br/> <br/>- A little gem. Succinct. <br/></td>', 'I want to thank the Alternative Fine Arts Jury for awarding my Walk On By image in Fine Arts: Exhibit 2 as Second Honors. The image was not well received by the voters in the challenge, placed 145 of 162 images with the avarge score of 4.81. But the jury just made my day. I am deeply humbled.  The comments from the jury: One image that I totally missed when voting is Walk on By. I''m liking this more and more... love the shape of the legs! Go-go boots! Colors are subtly wonderful. It makes you work and it rewards you.  - I also missed Walk on By and find the shapes and colors to be gorgeous.  - I like the movement, the 1960-Nancy Sinatra-ish of this. It''s so hip and cool!  - A little gem. Succinct. ', '2011-04-21 08:37:36.000000', NULL, 0),
